  "ruleText": "Agr 2212.01 Official Definitions. Except as the commissioner designates otherwise in specific cases under these rules, or by statue, the definitions shall be those adopted and published in the Recommended Uniform State Seed Law by the Association of American Seed Control Officials, Edition 2016, available as specified in Appendix II.\n\nSource. #12576, eff 7-21-18",
